<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 305)</h2>
<p><b>Gamma on the web: presets that know what they're compensating.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Web shares now declare how their proxies are encoded (Rec.709 or sRGB, from your app's own color settings), and the web &#947; control became labeled presets — Auto picks the right compensation for the viewer's platform and shows the number it chose; Off and the two directional trims are one click.</li>
<li>The web compare panel is draggable — grab the COMPARE label and move it off the timeline.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
